<title>NORWAY: Norway expands S466 bond by 3.0 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway expands S466 bond by 3.0 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 3.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: May 31, 2001</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: November 11, 0900gmt</p>
<p>NOTES: This is an expansion of bond S466 issued on May 29, 1995</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
